      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلِيجٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْلُوجٌ</span></b>  Cotton <i>upon which the operation signified by the verb</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلَجَ</span> <i>has been performed;</i> (S, K;) cotton <i>separated,</i> or <i>cleared,
